## Context

Ticket 0212 ships the §3 proposal + capability-timeline swimlane figure
with **partial** data for Qwen (Alibaba) and DeepSeek. Of 14 (lab,
stage) cells across those two labs, 4 are populated with verified
primary-source dates (Qwen-7B 2023-08-03, QwQ-32B-Preview 2024-11-28,
DeepSeek LLM 67B 2023-11-29, DeepSeek-R1 2025-01-20). The remaining 10
cells are flagged `TBD` (date column empty, `source_kind` literal
`TBD` or `absent`) and render as a grey right-margin annotation in
the figure so the gap stays visible.

Closing this ticket means promoting each TBD cell to one of:
- a verified primary-source date (lab announcement blog, English or
  Chinese), OR
- an explicit "no productised consumer surface as of <cutoff>" annotation
  recorded as `source_kind=absent` in the CSV.

This is exactly the "if gaps perform more deep research" work the
author asked for during the 0212 design dialogue (2026-05-21).

## TBD cells (10)

| Lab | Stage | Status in 0212 ship | Action |
|---|---|---|---|
| Alibaba | 2 Retrieval / file upload | TBD | find Tongyi Qianwen file-upload launch (likely 2024) |
| Alibaba | 3 Browsing / web search | TBD | find Tongyi web-search product launch |
| Alibaba | 5 Deep research | TBD | Qwen3 / Tongyi deep-research surface — verify whether shipped |
| Alibaba | 6 Tool use / agents | TBD | Qwen-Agent framework primary date OR consumer agent surface |
| Alibaba | 7 Multi-agent | TBD | verify whether a consumer multi-agent surface exists |
| DeepSeek | 2 Retrieval / file upload | TBD | DeepSeek Chat file-upload launch |
| DeepSeek | 3 Browsing / web search | TBD | DeepSeek Chat web-search launch |
| DeepSeek | 5 Deep research | absent (conjectured) | confirm no productised deep-research consumer surface |
| DeepSeek | 6 Tool use / agents | TBD | API tool-use exists; verify consumer agent surface |
| DeepSeek | 7 Multi-agent | absent (conjectured) | confirm no productised multi-agent consumer surface |

## Method

1. **Web search per cell.** Primary lab blog / press release, in
   English or Chinese. Chinese-language announcements are acceptable —
   record the URL as-is, transliterate the title in the note column.
2. **Domain priority for primaries.** Alibaba: `qwenlm.github.io`,
   `tongyi.aliyun.com`, `damo.alibaba.com`, official Qwen X/Twitter,
   `huggingface.co/Qwen` model card release dates as fallback.
   DeepSeek: `deepseek.com`, `api-docs.deepseek.com`, official
   DeepSeek X/Twitter, `huggingface.co/deepseek-ai`.
3. **Tertiary aggregators (techcrunch, theverge, infoworld) are not
   accepted** as the primary source — they may serve as cross-check
   pointers only.
4. **Definite-absence ruling.** A cell may be closed as
   `source_kind=absent` if (a) no productised consumer-facing surface
   exists as of the cutoff date AND (b) absence is checked against
   the lab's own announcements page through cutoff. Record the
   cutoff date in the note column.

## Cutoff date

2026-05-21 (the date the §3 proposal ships). Cells that flip from
absent → present after this date are followed up in a separate ticket;
this ticket lands the snapshot used by §3.

## Test

```python
def test_capability_timeline_no_tbd_in_focus_panel():
    """data/capability_timeline.csv has no TBD source_kind cells for
    labs in Experiment 1's panel after 0223 closes."""
    rows = read_csv("data/capability_timeline.csv")
    tbd_cells = [r for r in rows
                 if r["lab"] in {"Anthropic", "OpenAI", "Mistral",
                                  "Alibaba", "DeepSeek"}
                 and r["source_kind"] == "TBD"]
    assert tbd_cells == [], f"unresolved TBD cells: {tbd_cells}"


def test_capability_timeline_citation_keys_unique():
    """Each non-empty citation_key must point at a refs.bib entry."""
    # Implementation: parse refs.bib once, assert every non-empty
    # citation_key in the CSV is present.
```

## Exit criteria

- [ ] All 10 TBD cells resolved to either a verified date or an
      explicit absent ruling, with primary-source URLs in the note
      column.
- [ ] `data/capability_timeline.csv` updated; no TBD strings remain
      for the five Exp 1 labs.
- [ ] Citations added to `report/refs.bib` for any new primary
      sources cited in §3 prose.
- [ ] `docs/capability-timeline.md` rewritten to the five-lab panel
      (drop Google to footnote, add Qwen + DeepSeek narrative
      paragraphs matching the existing OpenAI / Anthropic / Mistral
      sections).
- [ ] Figure re-rendered; no TBD annotations remain in the right
      margin of the swimlane.
- [ ] Adherence test for "no TBD cells in focus panel" added.
- [ ] `make slides` builds with the updated figure.

## Boundary

This ticket does **not** edit `slides/manuscript/main.md`. That edit
ships with 0219 after the author signs off on the proposal. The
0219/0223 split is: 0219 = the §3 prose and the figure framework;
0223 = filling the data gaps the framework exposes.
